{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/048494be14e4d1ee67fb53fb071d3e89.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=184 /></span><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Lose yourself in huge maps, and get the zoomies:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Developer\u2019s Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for playing The Last Humble Bee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I consider this game complete and am now focusing on new projects, but I\u2019m really proud of what we made together. I may revisit Humble Bee down the road, but for now, I\u2019m excited to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers, Jacob Weersing</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're not my Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/8a2cbcc4decc4ee975400871f0431fd4e8760b4b.jpg"},{"name":"Heart of the Cards","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/d17872cada18dc255db7123df85b7c5bbff20148.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a DJ. Are you a DJ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/cf289080906be6b0749b19a1e03cd620f12d7d08.jpg"},{"name":"Paging Doctor Z","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/0c06fe523f95784976c05598faa44c31ea8f826b.jpg"},{"name":"Achieved Flo(w) state","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/fcc54892ab645be134651324c3f2d0ad74f9e125.jpg"},{"name":"Goku Power Level 9000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/fc7d6c1d3849ea41feb29a2968ab691dfe79666d.jpg"},{"name":"It's a Killer Derby!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/7720b03833ae7326b5e3785c0a6afa3750ae1cc1.jpg"},{"name":"School\u2019s in session, Lyn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/7017a7aadd8f80ec77847c7dedadde5c77f63665.jpg"},{"name":"Robin\u2019s Gacha Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/15fdd5530f82c114fbc676b8387cda0bbb3f8b16.jpg"},{"name":"Soup\u2019s done!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2190150/63034cd421bc9337b9748f32e1941f3550f62673.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2190150?t=1754978183","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754978183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754978183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754978183","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2807950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/048494be14e4d1ee67fb53fb071d3e89.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=184 /></span><strong>The Last Humble Bee</strong> is a heart-buzzing bumble bee rogue-like where you swashbuckle, bounce, and barrel-blast through a desaturated pixel art world to &quot;Save the Bees&quot; from eternal damnation!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Play as a Swashbuckling Warrior Bee:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/ad4e70934472ce915d87cdce1ee58660.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Jump, dodge/roll, and attack your way to bumble bee glory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Customize your own Deck of Magical Upgrades:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/aac4426c8630f6519c49bf25f2d4f215.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A deckbuilding system enables you to choose your own (random) upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Lose yourself in huge maps, and get the zoomies:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.poster.avif?t=1754978183\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.webm?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/extras/6c00d49d837f9ce147c199deca6f5730.mp4?t=1754978183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore for treasure or jump into a barrel cannon to blast across the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design, Art, and Audio harken back to the days of 16-bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce over gaps! Duel with enemies! Find treasure! Uncover secrets! Upgrade!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light touch to narrative with humor, levity, and heart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >De-saturated pixel art with big chunky outlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging gameplay that warmly welcomes newcomers, yet leaves room for expert-level maneuvering</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Developer\u2019s Note:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks so much for playing The Last Humble Bee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I consider this game complete and am now focusing on new projects, but I\u2019m really proud of what we made together. I may revisit Humble Bee down the road, but for now, I\u2019m excited to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers, Jacob Weersing</p>","developers":["Jacob Weersing"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2190150/header.jpg?t=1754978183","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright YakobSoup LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2190150/679289/4a346db60153a35c90db071bcdbcd4394e390642/1751087625/dash_av1.mpd?t=1711375378","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2190150/679289/4a346db60153a35c90db071bcdbcd4394e390642/1751087625/dash_h264.mpd?t=1711375378","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2190150/679289/4a346db60153a35c90db071bcdbcd4394e390642/1751087625/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1711375378","id":257011010,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257011010/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1711375378"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2190150/669610/7d5586432ae9683a39b4dd2550aaf3ba1e90ab71/1751087624/dash_av1.mpd?t=1709508912","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2190150/669610/7d5586432ae9683a39b4dd2550aaf3ba1e90ab71/1751087624/da